The key issues being fixed:

1. Tables need minimum widths to trigger horizontal scrolling - the projects table has 10 columns which is too many to fit
2. The .table-responsive div needs proper overflow settings
3. Card bodies need to allow overflow scrolling
4. The main content area needs to allow horizontal scrolling when content is wider than the viewport

After making these changes, users will be able to scroll horizontally to see all columns in the tables. The sidebar will no longer cover the content because the main content area will scroll horizontally when needed.
